<title>USA: Mecklermedia authorizes $2 mln buyback.</title>
<headline>Mecklermedia authorizes $2 mln buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mecklermedia Corp said on Monday that its board authorized the repurchase of up to $2 million of its common shares.</p>
<p>In early afternoon trading on the Nasdaq,  Mecklermedia's shares were down 5/8 at 17-1/2 on volume of 50,900 shares.</p>
<p>The number of shares outstanding was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
